{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Post-remediation RUF census (Ruff 0.16.1, current origin/main df34119e02).\n\nSTARTING live narrow census (ruff check --select RUF --ignore RUF001,RUF002,RUF003,RUF100 --statistics src/rebar tests) = 179 actionable diagnostics: RUF059=68, RUF022=38, RUF012=26, RUF005=20, RUF043=12, RUF023=6, RUF007=2, RUF028=2, RUF034=2, RUF019=1, RUF046=1, RUF102=1.\n\nRemediation: Ruff safe --fix (39) + reviewed unsafe --fix for the mechanical families (RUF059 unused-unpacked -> _prefix; RUF005 concat -> unpacking; RUF007 zip -> itertools.pairwise; RUF046 cast; RUF022/RUF023 sorted __all__/__slots__; RUF019/RUF102). Manual: RUF012 -> typing.ClassVar[...] annotations (26, all test stub classes); RUF043 -> raw-string match= patterns (12, byte-identical regex); RUF028 -> removed 2 invalid in-arglist fmt-suppression comments; RUF034 -> collapsed 2 useless if-else. RUF001/RUF002/RUF003 deferred in [tool.ruff.lint].ignore (intentional prose/UI Unicode).\n\nPOST-remediation narrow census = 0 (ruff check --select RUF --ignore RUF001,RUF002,RUF003,RUF100 src/rebar tests exits 0).\n\nAUTHORITATIVE RUF100 under the FULL configured rule set: 'ruff check src tests' exits 0 (All checks passed). Enabling RUF activated RUF100 tree-wide, surfacing 374 genuinely-stale noqa directives (124 unused BLE001 on handlers ruff exempts via logging/re-raise; 59 redundant T201 in per-file-ignored paths; ANN001/ANN201/ANN2xx, F401/F811/F841, E402, PLC0415, PT011, S3xx/S1xx, ARG, N8xx, D1xx, B017) which were removed via ruff's precise RUF100 autofix. The 771 narrow-selection RUF100 artifacts were NOT used to drive removals (per plan). make lint exits 0; default test tier: 10747 passed (only pre-existing host-environmental failures: safe.bareRepository git-remote tests + metric-backend tool absent, each reproduced on the clean tree)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785980305098409001,"uuid":"de3b7a4c-9a4f-4e40-9f21-916f0aac1087"}